# ===========================================
# PUBLIC REPO SAFETY NET
# ===========================================
# These patterns act as a LAST LINE OF DEFENSE
# if files are ever pushed directly to public repo
# instead of going through the sync script.
#
# The sync script (scripts/sync-dual-repos.mjs) handles
# the actual filtering. These patterns protect against
# accidental direct git pushes to the public remote.
#
# IMPORTANT: The private repo sync script IGNORES .gitignore
# and uses its own file walker, so these rules do NOT
# affect what goes into the private repo.
# ===========================================

